------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROOF OF THE PUDDING

When the Moon is New, dance in a clockwise circle out-of-doors, saying
or singing:

	Uranus, Diana and Mercury!
	Is Magic true? Can Magic be?
	A Magic Sign I'd have from thee-
	Shaddai El Chai and Ea, Ge!
