Another standard introduction is _Einfuehrung in die vergleichende
Sprachwissenschaft_ (Introduction to Comparative Linguistics), by
the Hungarian linguist Oszwald Szemerenyi (sp.?)  Although it is in
German, it contains many useful tables of verbal an nominal paradigms,
which can be understood by those with a knowledge of a few basic
vocabulary words.  I too am unaware of any introductory or reference
work written in English.  

